ses a dictatorship and renames the country <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yugoslavia">Yugoslavia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1934</span><span class="rf-text">King Alexander is assassinated in Marseille</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1939</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cvetkovic-macek-agreement">Cvetković-Maček Agreement</a> creates the Banovina of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/croatia">Croatia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1941</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a> and its allies invade and the army surrenders on 17 April</span></li></ol>
